To create an IAM policy that grants read-only access to a single S3 bucket, you can use the following example policy:

```
{
    "Version": "2012-10-17",
    "Statement": {
        "Effect": "Allow",
        "Action": [
            "s3:GetObject",
            "s3:ListBucket"
        ],
        "Resource": [
            "arn:aws:s3:::input-bucket-name",
            "arn:aws:s3:::input-bucket-name/*"
        ]
    }
}
```

This policy allows the actions `s3:GetObject` and `s3:ListBucket` for the specified S3 bucket and its objects.

